  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "66b8727c4fd3fb8f109afea94335699edb24facd9ff6662c82605d8252ff0b19",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十八关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "It's dangerous to lose focus on the battlefield.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'm sorry...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I just... am having trouble understanding...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Reunion has bunkered down inside an abandoned mine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "That woman, W, also fled inside.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I can give you some space if you need time alone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "However, the L.G.D. has no time to waste.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hoshiguma, gather the others.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "(Misha...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I have one concern.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Concern?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "W is a master of explosives.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "It's highly likely that she has deployed traps on the battlefield.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'm worried that... we'd sustain heavy casualties from a direct confrontation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "My suggestion is for Rhodes Island to sneak into the mine while your forces set up an encirclement.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We'll flush out the Reunion forces, and you can arrest them immediately...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "And those who refuse to surrender, we'll handle our way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "How confident do you feel about facing that woman?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'm not sure...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...But we can bear that risk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We've fought her more than once before. At least we have some understanding of her fighting style.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "There are some risks... that the L.G.D. can't afford to shoulder.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "We can't afford to lose sight of the mission objective either.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "PC94172, take our forces and surround the mines!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hoshiguma, pick out a few troops to take with you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "We'll each take a squad and move in with Rhodes Island.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hoshiguma, you and Rhodes Island will split off and pincer them. Destroy their base of operations, and rout their defenses.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I'll take care of the firebases.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "For Lungmen's sake, we have to...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...bring Misha back.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...Understood.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'll gather our operators.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Ch'en, there's a small group of Reunion forces heading out along the edge of the mines.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "They're moving pretty quickly, too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "I'll head out first, otherwise we might lose them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hurry. Don't let them get away.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Ah, Madam Hoshiguma, please wait a moment.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "When they ambushed us earlier, they were hiding some casters among their forces.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'd recommend taking two of our operators, Franka and Liskarm, with your squad.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "They have a lot of experience fighting casters.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "No problem.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "All right, let's do this, shall we?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "What about you, Amiya?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit told us to...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Penguin Logistics is backing me up, so I'll be fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Sounds like a plan.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I can't stress this enough, but don't be too stubborn. Back off if the situation gets too rough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Amiya?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We don't have much time left.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This isn't like Chernobog... This time, it's our turn to stop Reunion!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
